WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:01.210
- [Kelly] I'm so intrigued.

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:02.350
I've never done anything like this.

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.410
- [Theresa] Okay, great.

00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:05.706
So, um,

00:00:05.706 --> 00:00:07.640
(sighs)

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.580
so there is a mother
energy that is present

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:11.220
so if your mom is not departed,

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.190
it would be like a grandmother or an aunt

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:14.940
or someone that was like a mother to you.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:16.790
- It could literally be any of those

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:19.580
'cause everyone died before me (laughs).

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:20.830
- Oh okay, but right now
- Yeah.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:21.860
your mom is here in the physical world?

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:23.010
- My mom is alive, yeah.
- Okay.

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:24.150
- You're very fortunate

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:26.140
because you have not
lost a lot of people here

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:26.990
in the physical world.

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:29.499
- Yeah, I don't know many
people that have passed away.

00:00:29.499 --> 00:00:32.190
- Right, well can I talk
about the dad that's departed.

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:33.420
- Oh my dad did die.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:34.387
Oh I don't know him.

00:00:34.387 --> 00:00:35.820
- Oh!
- Oh yeah I'm sorry.

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:36.653
- Oh okay.

00:00:36.653 --> 00:00:38.080
I was gonna just ask you about pie.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:38.913
- I love pie.

00:00:38.913 --> 00:00:39.746
- That's what they told me!

00:00:39.746 --> 00:00:41.750
They go Kelly loves pie!
- I love pie.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:42.960
They showed me cherry pie

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:43.960
and I'm like okay,

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:45.640
what am I supposed to say
with that? I don't have a -

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:47.980
- Oh that's funny, cherry
pie's my sister thing,

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:50.610
but she's the one he's
probably trying to talk to.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:52.470
- Well listen.
- We don't know each other.

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:53.790
- But you have to understand

00:00:53.790 --> 00:00:55.820
your dad could not take responsibility

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:57.240
for things in his life here

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:58.690
in the physical world.
- Not a one.

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:00.530
His soul is stepping forward and saying

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:01.980
I know what you felt.

00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:03.000
I know what you went through

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.310
and for that I am sorry.

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:06.210
- Oh I've already forgiven. So I'm good.

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.223
But I'm not like mad at
it, if he can hear me.

00:01:08.223 --> 00:01:09.460
- No! No no no!
- Oh I was like...

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:10.380
- That's not what this is about.

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:11.213
- Okay.

00:01:11.213 --> 00:01:12.850
- You have to understand
it's where someone

00:01:12.850 --> 00:01:14.770
if they hurt us or disappoint us

00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:17.430
if only if the soul has learned the lesson

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:18.890
to see things differently,

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:20.760
they can come through and say that, so...

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:22.020
- All right!

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:23.103
I'll tell my sister.

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:27.720
- For your dad to be
able to come through...

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.600
- Oh yeah Candice did lose someone, yes.

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:30.750
- Who are you?

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:31.830
- [Candice] I'm Candice.
- She's my stylist.

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:33.600
- Oh hi, nice to meet you.
- So nice to meet you.

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:35.330
- Oh my god, my very first
thing you said was mother

00:01:35.330 --> 00:01:36.520
and I was thinking my life,

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:38.120
but her mother recently passed.

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:39.360
That's right!

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:40.193
- [Candice] Yeah.

00:01:40.193 --> 00:01:41.026
- Yeah.

00:01:41.026 --> 00:01:42.505
- Were you watching her breath at the end?

00:01:42.505 --> 00:01:43.338
- Yeah.

00:01:43.338 --> 00:01:44.550
- Okay, so,

00:01:44.550 --> 00:01:45.610
your mom just says to me, she says

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:48.210
please tell my daughter I
know how much she misses me

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:49.913
- (whispers) I do.

